function libpp hal_mac_txq_disable
disposition direct
protocol wifi
rust-component open_esp_radio_esp32s31_registers::generated::hal_mac_txq_disable
binding v1
rust-probe open_libpp_tx_trace_hal_mac_txq_disable
effect-contract exact-effects-v1
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d40 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d40 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d50 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d50 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d60 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d60 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d70 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d70 required

# The vendor root continues into private queue context, HE trigger-based
# scheduling and statistics after the finite register publication. The
# adapter qualifies that responsibility split explicitly; it does not claim
# whole-function equivalence.
function libpp hal_mac_txq_enable
disposition replaced-by-composition
protocol wifi
rust-component open_esp_radio_esp32s31_registers::generated::hal_mac_txq_enable_register_slice
binding v1
rust-probe open_libpp_tx_trace_hal_mac_txq_enable_register_slice
driver-adapter esp32s31-hal-mac-txq-enable-register-slice-v1
effect-contract exact-effects-v1
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d40 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d40 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d50 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d50 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d60 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d60 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104d70 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104d70 required
effect platform-provided-service embassy-tx-queue-ownership required
effect platform-call debug-diagnostic allowed-omission unused-instrumentation
effect initialization-prerequisite he-trigger-based-tx-disabled required
